# The build context is the repo root, so keep the VCS history, the local
# virtualenv, the local model cache and every built index out of it. The
# image downloads its own copy of the embedding model and builds its own
# index into the volume. tests/ is deliberately NOT ignored: the
# Dockerfile's test stage needs it.
.git
.gitignore
.venv/
.fastembed/
index/
index-*/
docs/
eval/results/
eval/heldout.jsonl
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.playwright-mcp/
.env
